    },
    {
      "fact": "Each published year gives a total of 195 openings: 2025/26, 2026/27 and 2027/28.",
      "source": "https://www.lancashire.gov.uk/children-education-families/schools/school-term-dates-and-holidays/"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The council runs an online school calendar where parents can look up the calendar of an individual Lancashire school.",
      "source": "https://schoolcalendar.lancashire.gov.uk/schoolSelect.asp"
    },
    {
      "fact": "In 2027/28 the spring term starts on Tuesday 4 January 2028 and the summer term on Tuesday 18 April 2028, after a late Easter.",
      "source": "https://www.lancashire.gov.uk/children-education-families/schools/school-term-dates-and-holidays/"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The May Day bank holiday is listed inside the summer term each year: Monday 3 May 2027 and Monday 1 May 2028.",
